{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》於11月24日正式首播，Ivy So以破格型格造型驚喜登場，大騷纖腰長腿，旋即成為全場焦點。眾位玩家在校園展開逃脫大戰，為避開獵人追捕不惜出盡奇招，有人企圖以金錢賄賂，亦有人拿起道具槍反擊。豈料遊戲尾聲的無情輪盤懲罰環節突然出現戲劇性反轉，令全場爆笑失控。Ivy So驚喜登場大騷纖...</p>\n<p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》於11月24日正式首播，Ivy So以破格型格造型驚喜登場，大騷纖腰長腿，旋即成為全場焦點。眾位玩家在校園展開逃脫大戰，為避開獵人追捕不惜出盡奇招，有人企圖以金錢賄賂，亦有人拿起道具槍反擊。豈料遊戲尾聲的無情輪盤懲罰環節突然出現戲劇性反轉，令全場爆笑失控。</p>\n<h2>Ivy So驚喜登場大騷纖腰長腿</h2>\n<p>首集節目中，Ivy So以一身型格造型登場，修身上衣配搭不規則剪裁，若隱若現大騷纖腰；下身襯上同色系超短褲，將修長美腿表露無遺。整體造型性感之餘亦散發叛逆氣息，成功成為全場焦點！</p>\n<h2>吳肇軒試圖賄賂獵人Alton慘遭拒絕</h2>\n<p>眾人逃出密室後隨即面臨獵人Alton窮追猛打，他跑得極快連攝影師都無法跟上步伐。吳肇軒眼見形勢不利企圖賄賂獵人，直接詢問對方演出酬勞有多少，結果Alton毫不留情回應：「首先要有show先，但你就問個冇乜show嘅人，好難答到你」。另一邊廂邱士縉施展後尾枕演技試圖欺騙獵人，而吳肇軒更打算拿起道具槍射擊反抗，結果發現只是一把無法發揮作用蠱惑玩具槍。</p>\n<h2>真人騷首播Jason重溫黑仔王宿命</h2>\n<p>遊戲尾聲眾人必須透過轉動無情輪盤決定獎品與懲罰，代表敗者陣容Jason竟然幸運轉到免罰區域。大家眼見製作組大感失望兼且準備大量道具，便決定全體一同測試生蛋與熟蛋懲罰。在綜藝之神強烈眷顧下，Jason隨機抽中生蛋並狠狠砸在自己身上，完美重現他過去在綜藝節目中一貫倒霉形象，再次確立其無人能及黑仔王地位。</p>\n<h2>觀眾激讚IvySo長腿與郭嘉駿綜藝感</h2>\n<p>節目未開播已經在網絡上引發廣泛討論，大批網民對於Ivy So破格打扮感到驚喜，紛紛留言：「支持Ivy支持《輪盤遊戲》」。郭嘉駿憑藉一貫機智搞笑作風同樣贏得觀眾熱烈迴響，有粉絲激動表示：「超期待睇33」。針對雷濠權再次中招受罰畫面，不少網民直指他與郭嘉駿之間互動充滿火花，整個校園追捕與密室解謎過程節奏緊湊兼且笑料百出。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799464315214_20152834696b05953b2fc76.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-24 at 22.37.39.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799464315214_20152834696b05953b2fc76.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799943650996_14247062776b05953fce63e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Restored high-definition documentary frame-1.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552799943650996_14247062776b05953fce63e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552800810436872_10646346876b059549186dc.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Restored documentary video frame-2.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552800810436872_10646346876b059549186dc.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552801608333124_2607761276b05955079cf1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-24 at 21.50.18.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552801608333124_2607761276b05955079cf1.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552802295831392_2782616436b0595576b19c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reality show egg wheel challenge-1.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552802295831392_2782616436b0595576b19c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:03:53.236566+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1233,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:30:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:51.832240+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:57:24.488817+00:00","content_hash":"c5d884b2129ae74681df2a4c6ace7a5c5a28a3616d9e09e8964c20717554a1c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}